      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00061",
        "explanation": "Doctor instructs family to use practical, low-intrusion verification methods like calling the nurse and observing without unwrapping the dressing.",
        "quote": "您看到外面没有明显流血，记录也写着无渗血/血肿，说明目前穿刺部位情况是好的。您不需要自己去解开纱布看，只要注意别让手腕过度弯曲或用力就行。"
      }
    ]
