      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively reconstructed the staged care timeline by asking the family for chronology and using workspace queries to inspect relevant record categories (R01-R05). They mapped the transfer to cardiology, PCI, post-procedure status, and still-uncertain follow-up tests/discharge medications, and explained how the timeline changes what must be verified next. This is beyond minimum responsibility and not merely stating records are incomplete.",
