        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged the patient's dignity and explained the safety reason for each minimum data item, offered low-intrusion methods to verify medications/BP/adherence, and documented remaining unknowns. The family successfully cooperated to provide limited information through practical verification steps. This is an effective repair of the real-world privacy barrier beyond the minimum RC7 attempt.",
